# Through the private SSH forward. Supply an actual confirmed app-user JWT in
# your local HTTP client's private environment, never in this tracked file.
@origin = http://localhost:6086
@organization = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@scan = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@request = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Workspace page
GET {{origin}}/

### Static script
GET {{origin}}/portal.js

### Static styles
GET {{origin}}/portal.css

### Public project settings
GET {{origin}}/api/config

### Listener readiness (does not attest to app-user acceptance)
GET {{origin}}/internal/ready

### Protocol description
GET {{origin}}/openapi/v1.json

### Verify signed-in user
GET {{origin}}/api/session
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

### Atomically create or resume your personal workspace
POST {{origin}}/api/workspace
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Read authorized workspace
GET {{origin}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

### Recent runs
GET {{origin}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

### Admit fixed shop fixture (replace zero request with a fresh UUID; reuse on retry)
POST {{origin}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{request}}"}

### Verified result
GET {{origin}}/api/workspaces/{{organization}}/scans/{{scan}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
